# Work — inputs and intermediates, never published, never committed.
#
# Source photographs are downloaded at up to 1600 pixels, baked into a slide
# within seconds, and never posted. Reel frames are 1080x1920 PNGs that exist
# only until ffmpeg has read them. Both used to be written under data/, which
# is what gets pushed, and the repository was carrying about 290 MB of
# throwaway JPEGs after a handful of days. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
work/
